{"id":"funcio_n","lemma":"función","pos":"noun","rank":2391,"glosses":["function","showing","a function; a subroutine, method, or procedure which returns an output value and may accept input values"],"ipa":"/funˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"funciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-funci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿A qué hora empieza la función?","en":"What time does the show start?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645629","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"hour"},{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La función se acabó.","en":"The show is over.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444302","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"enough is enough!…"]]},{"text":"La función del corazón es bombear sangre.","en":"The function of the heart is to pump blood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598523","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to pump"},{"g":"blood"}]},{"text":"La función fue bien acogida.","en":"The show was well attended.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"welcome, welcoming"}]},{"text":"Habrá otra función de esta película en dos horas.","en":"There will be another showing of this movie in two hours.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},null,null,null,{"g":"film"},null,null,{"g":"hour","l":"hora"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"definitely this time"],[6,8,"asunder"]]}]}